  "pending": {
    "_comment": [
      "E1 commands the bridge node does not implement yet. The TS suite skips",
      "these (and asserts they are skipped for a reason); the Python client",
      "suite asserts them in full, because the plugin side ships now.",
      "",
      "'attach_all_roles' and the 'set_state_*' family exist so every §4.2 role,",
      "state key and command name is carried by a real frame rather than a list in",
      "a test file — tests/test_bridge_protocol_frames.py enumerates the",
      "vocabularies from bridge_protocol.ROLE_STATE_KEYS / ROLE_COMMANDS and fails",
      "if any of them has no frame. onOffLight's set_state is the plain 'set_state'",
      "entry above; the rest are named per role."
    ],
